        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=5c52cc7d-2c0c-3a6d-aaaa-9bcf709d422d
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of Azerbaijani natural gas in an offshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport offshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c52cc7d-2c0c-3a6d-aaaa-9bcf709d422d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
